  Keys  /keys                                                        Esc returns
 Enter                       send Send a prompt, or a steering message during a
 Shift+Enter, Ctrl+J         line_break Insert a line break
 Esc                         close_or_interrupt Close what is on top; interrupt
 Ctrl+C                      clear_then_quit Clear the draft, then quit
 ⌥0                          go_home Go home
 Ctrl+N                      new_session Start a new session
 ⌥1 ⌥2 ⌥3 ⌥4 ⌥5 ⌥6 ⌥7 ⌥8 ⌥9  rail_row_n Switch to the session of rail card N
 Delete, Backspace           delete_session Delete the selected exited session i
 ↑                           recall_prompt Recall an earlier prompt from the pro
 ←                           focus_rail Move focus from an empty input box into
⋮Ctrl+R                      search_prompts Search those prompts
⋮⌥← ⌥→, Ctrl+← Ctrl+→, ⌥B ⌥F move_word Move by word
⋮⌥Backspace                  delete_word Delete a word
 Ctrl+U                      delete_to_line_start Delete to the start of the lin
 ⌘← ⌘→                       line_start_end Start or end of the line
 Ctrl+G                      open_in_editor Open the draft, or a pasted token, i
 Ctrl+V                      paste_image Paste an image
 Ctrl+O                      toggle_ledgers Open or close the ledgers
 Not saved: disk full
